# Testing & Quality Assurance Rules

1. Before pushing code or preparing for deployment, always execute `npm run build` to verify webpack bundling.
2. Verify TypeScript types: `npx tsc --noEmit` must pass without syntax/type errors.
3. Test edge cases: invalid email format, expired token, forbidden role access, and missing body fields.
4. Rate limiting test: verify 6 rapid requests trigger HTTP 429.
